---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us | Airdroplyx">
  <Header />
  <main class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-4 py-16 prose prose-slate">
    <h1>About Airdroplyx</h1>
    
    <p>Welcome to Airdroplyx, your premier multi-lingual aggregator for cryptocurrency airdrops, bounties, and decentralized finance (DeFi) opportunities.</p>
    
    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>Our mission is to democratize access to the Web3 ecosystem by making it easier for users globally to discover, verify, and participate in legitimate cryptocurrency airdrops without falling victim to scams.</p>
    
    <h2>What We Do</h2>
    <p>We actively monitor the blockchain space to find projects that are giving away free tokens to their early adopters. We research these projects, verify their authenticity, and create easy-to-follow, step-by-step guides.</p>
    
    <h2>Global Reach</h2>
    <p>We believe Web3 is global. That is why we provide our guides in 10 different languages, ensuring that non-English speakers have equal access to the best opportunities in the cryptocurrency space.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>
